abstract: >-
  Certified outage bounds for RIS-NOMA with source-side thermal energy harvesting.
  Extraction dated 24 November 2026 from the reproducibility archive that produced
  the submitted Letter's results. Reproduces Table II identically. New author
  code is BSD-3-Clause, extracted code retains MIT and numerical data CC-BY-4.0;
  the combined distribution uses BSD-3-Clause AND MIT AND CC-BY-4.0.
